+    The completion gate runs under the engine's fixed critical-hook timeout
+    (60 s, not configurable per hook). Any gate that re-decodes and re-hashes a
+    nontrivial export blows that budget. Before the fix the task parked in
+    waiting_approval with output_url null and GET .../file answered 409 forever,
+    and the parked run could never be recovered because the immutable export
